    "body": "[Verify that users have a method to remove **or** export their data on demand.](https://github.com/OWASP/ASVS/blob/master/4.0/en/0x16-V8-Data-Protection.md)\r\n\r\nThere are two requirements here:\r\n* users must be able to export their data\r\n* users must be able to remove their data\r\n\r\nThe way this requirement is currently stated allows implementors to choose either of these. I don't think that makes sense. Export and removal do not solve the same problem.\r\n\r\nThe \"method\" this requirements mentions can also be to email the support desk, it doesn't have to be integrated in the application, in my opinion. In that case, does this even belong in the ASVS? What is the application's role in this? Should every application have export functionality built in? Should every application have functionality to remove data built in?",
